In hell you will never find any stairway down.The only way of descending
is by means of level teleport.
If you have a ring of teleport-control, it is quite easy:
Just wait until you step on a level teleporter and teleport on level  
50(the lowest), and go up until you find the wizard(somewhere between  
level 30 and 50).
If you find no level teleporter on your level, go to the castle again and  
again (you must have found a stairway up) and step on one of the traps  
where you fall down. It sometimes happens that you fall to a different  
level, where you may find a level teleporter.
Another possibility of level teleporting is reading a scroll of teleport  
while being confused(potion, Umberhulk,...).
Without a ring of teleport-control it could get difficult, because you  
have to wait until you are teleported down.
